      <memberdef kind="define" id="emf__print_8h_1a6710a7a0dd075a545aa20ef41fd4f102" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>EMF_PRINT</name>
        <param><defname>fmt</defname></param>
        <param><defname>...</defname></param>
        <initializer>  do                                      \
  {                                       \
    if (<ref refid="emf__print_8h_1a57ca66445a18ffc13d0f305ab75e9c8d" kindref="member">EMF_PRINT_NARG</ref>(__VA_ARGS__) == 0) \
    {                                     \
      <ref refid="emf__print_8h_1aa2affc0918cda6aaf259b4492d973f86" kindref="member">EMF_print</ref>(fmt, NULL);               \
    }                                     \
    else                                  \
    {                                     \
      uintptr_t args[] = {__VA_ARGS__};   \
      <ref refid="emf__print_8h_1aa2affc0918cda6aaf259b4492d973f86" kindref="member">EMF_print</ref>(fmt, args);               \
    }                                     \
  } while (0)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Safe variadic print macro using EMF_print. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If no arguments are passed, it calls EMF_print with NULL. Otherwise, it builds a local array of arguments and passes them.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000007"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Limit of 8 arguments is imposed by EMF_PRINT_NARG. </para>
<para>If the limit is changed update the documentation.</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This macro shall not be called from an active EBF critical section. See <ref refid="/workspaces/embedded_workbench/sw/ecf/embedded_middleware_framework/src/emf_print/inc/emf_print.h_1emf_stdout_critical_section_precondition" kindref="member">emf_stdout_critical_section_precondition</ref>.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">fmt</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Format string. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">...</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Variable arguments (max 8). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
